Package: core-terminal
Architecture: any
Description: terminal emulator with profiles and reusable window groups
 Core Terminal is a native GTK4 and VTE terminal emulator. Profiles store
 appearance and behavior, while window groups reopen ordered tabs with their
 saved profiles, directories, and terminal dimensions.
